{"type":"message","id":"f0073a92","parentId":"862238f7","timestamp":"2026-05-30T08:23:36.479Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"read_ts_AY89a182n5tLKH8XLbHcQ5NbrOWLpqbYa_PIbbhWy26GawJnJYk2oTfaCyX5wsFe0R0QVpza0_OCImF7vSX6vuWybineqJhB_pDXkJAABHt9K0FBXPOjjxo09zRGt6I8_ruozokzu7gfdM8MR2XddZq-SYmkBUUvZ4ZpiV2u_E4o6RnMmsxG4uHbiNC6-YekFPE8UIdOiGBxeIA1Ae7sXtHTgdpBr9li2Y43CjU_yMGrz414YkPrVT7GmW3DhXuDq74kGNcA6vWqClPrzl-hr0SvScXPjAZMN6MEPlHAKu2He9fldIyweLYaeAUqijEf1qSIBj80l77mEyVQMJqkDl6-S07rSEOW2R9_e6wt-OJCdg-qCu7-s94xVQyJLmRVAsWKHrPAMr4UYyA2nUVZjSZmpbDYnFUL1y8v9qvwVkwxdsFLvRBfbTSv","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Agent Pipeline Registry\n\n**Last updated:** 2026-05-27    \n**Purpose:** Canonical living reference for the OpenClaw crypto news pipeline — all agents, subagents, prompts, tools, skills, and pipeline steps.  \n**Config source of truth:** [`openclaw.json`](openclaw.json)\n\n> **Secrets policy:** This file documents *where* credentials live (`TOOLS.md`, `openclaw.json`, shell scripts) but never copies tokens, passwords, or API keys.\n\n---\n\n## Maintenance triggers\n\nUpdate this registry in the **same change** whenever you edit any of:\n\n| Category | Paths |\n|----------|-------|\n| Config | `openclaw.json`, `exec-approvals.json` |\n| Prompts | `workspace-*/SOUL.md`, `workspace-*/AGENTS.md`, `workspace-*/IDENTITY.md`, `workspace-*/TOOLS.md`, `workspace-writer/COINOGRAPHY_TEMPLATE.md` |\n| Skills | `workspace-*/skills/**`, `skills/**` |\n| Pipeline scripts | `workspace-orchestrator/skills/pipeline/**` |\n\nOn each update: bump **Last updated**, edit only affected sections, append one line to **Change log**.\n\n---\n\n## Architecture\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart TD\n    TG[TelegramUser] -->|run pipeline| NX[Nexus_orchestrator]\n    NX --> S0[Step0_init_run]\n    S0 --> S1[Step1_Scout_researcher]\n    S1 --> V1[validate_research_and_topic_dedup]\n    V1 --> S2[Step2_Quill_writer]\n    S2 --> V2[sync_structure_anchor_validators]\n    V2 --> S25{ENABLE_ARTICLE_CHARTS}\n    S25 -->|1| CH[Step2_5_chart_generator]\n    S25 -->|0 skip| S3\n    CH --> S3[Step3_Pixel_creator]\n    S3 --> S4[Step4_Press_publisher]\n    S4 --> S5[Step5_user_confirmation]\n    S5 -->|yes| S6[Step6_Scribe_wp_publisher]\n    S5 -->|no| DONE[Pipeline_complete]\n    S6 --> S6b[Step6b_build_and_send_card]\n    S6b --> TGCard[Telegram_news_agent_group]\n    TGCard --> Editorial[handle_card_feedback]\n    Editorial --> WPA[wp_post_actions_coinography]\n    S6b --> DONE\n```\n\n**Delegation:** `sessions_spawn` + `sessions_yield` only. Do **not** use `openclaw agent ... --deliver` in bash.\n\n**Handoffs:** File-first. Workers write to `/tmp/crypto-run-<RUN_ID>/` (symlinked from `/tmp/...`). Chat returns `\"SUCCESS\"` or structured status (`CHART_DONE:`, `WP_FAILED:`). Nexus validates disk artifacts with Python/bash scripts.\n\n**Entry point:** Telegram bound exclusively to `orchestrator` (`openclaw.json` → `bindings`).\n\n---\n\n## Global configuration\n\n| Setting | Value |\n|---------|-------|\n| Default model | `local-bifrost/gpt-5.4-mini` |\n| Default workspace | `/home/bhard/.openclaw/workspace` |\n| LLM backend | Bifrost Azure proxy (`local-bifrost` provider in `openclaw.json`) |\n| Tools profile | `coding` |\n| Exec security | `full`, `ask: off` |\n| Context injection | `always` |\n| Web search | SearXNG plugin (`paulgo.io`) |\n| Hooks | `session-memory`, `boot-md` |\n| Gateway | Local port 18789, token auth |\n\n---\n\n## Agent registry matrix\n\n| Agent ID | Persona | Workspace | Model | Pipeline step |\n|----------|---------|-----------|-------|---------------|\n| `main` | (default) | `workspace/` | gpt-5.4-mini | Not in pipeline |\n| `orchestrator` | Nexus | `workspace-orchestrator/` | gpt-5.4 | Controller (Steps 0–6) |\n| `researcher` | Scout | `workspace-researcher/` | gpt-5.4 | Step 1 — Research |\n| `writer` | Quill | `workspace-writer/` | gpt-5.4 | Step 2 — Write |\n| `chart-generator` | Pixel | `workspace-chart-generator/` | gpt-5.4-mini | Step 2.5 — Chart (optional) |\n| `creator` | Pixel | `workspace-creator/` | gpt-5.4-mini | Step 3 — Feature image |\n| `publisher` | Press | `workspace-publisher/` | gpt-5.4-mini | Step 4 — Google Drive |\n| `wp-publisher` | Scribe | `workspace-wp-publisher/` | gpt-5.4-mini | Step 6 — WordPress (user-gated) |\n\n**Orchestrator subagent allowlist:** `researcher`, `writer`, `chart-generator`, `creator`, `publisher`, `wp-publisher`\n\n---\n\n## Prompt assembly\n\nOpenClaw injects workspace markdown at session start:\n\n| File | Role |\n|------|------|\n| `SOUL.md` | Primary behavioral contract (the real prompt) |\n| `AGENTS.md` | Universal safety / worker rules |\n| `IDENTITY.md` | Name, role, emoji, vibe |\n\n[306 more lines in file. Use offset=101 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1780129416479}}
{"type":"message","id":"71bb729f","parentId":"f0073a92","timestamp":"2026-05-30T08:23:41.972Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] I have access to **6 specialized subagent workers** in the crypto news pipeline (plus the orchestration agent and myself, the main agent, for a total of 8 configured agent identities). \n\nHere is the breakdown of the subagent workers I can spawn or coordinate:\n\n1. **`researcher` (Scout):** Responsible for RSS feed monitoring, topic discovery, and deep-dive research.\n2. **`writer` (Quill):** Drafts and revises news articles using template structures and anchor link validators.\n3. **`chart-generator` (Pixel):** Generates factual crypto price charts using live CoinGecko data.\n4. **`creator` (Pixel):** Creates feature images for articles.\n5. **`publisher` (Press):** Handles document conversion and formatting (e.g., Google Drive / Docs uploading).\n6. **`wp-publisher` (Scribe):** Handles WordPress publishing, custom Telegram news card distribution, and feedback."}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"local-bifrost","model":"gemini-3.5-flash","usage":{"input":2044,"output":860,"cacheRead":38235,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":41139,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780129416481,"responseId":"i54aatzgF4uF694P1KisiQY"}}
